# Base URL of the slice gateway. Leave EMPTY for same-origin (the default).
#
# In local dev the Vite dev server proxies API/SSE prefixes to the gateway on :8080
# (see vite.config.js), so an empty base already reaches the gateway same-origin and the
# httpOnly session cookie rides along. Only set a full host if the gateway is on a
# different origin. The production build must stay empty (see .env.production) because the
# gateway serves dashboard/dist same-origin and every dashboard URL must be relative.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
